### Uses variables from .vscode/settings.json (local/production)

# ----- Format validation (local, no external API, never fails) -----

### Validate format of a French VAT number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/validate?vatNumber=FR89380129866
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Validate format of a German VAT number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/validate?vatNumber=DE123456789
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Validate format of an invalid VAT number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/validate?vatNumber=XX000000000
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Validate format - XML response
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/validate?vatNumber=FR89380129866&format=xml
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ----- Active check (external VIES API, cached) -----

### Check if French VAT number is active in VIES
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/check-active?vatNumber=FR89380129866
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Check if German VAT number is active in VIES
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/check-active?vatNumber=DE123456789
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Check active - XML response
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vies/check-active?vatNumber=FR89380129866&format=xml
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
